usage: create_tee_image.py [-h] [-d DEVICE] [-p PRELOADER]
                           donor payload [output]

positional arguments:
  donor                 The donor TEE to use as a base
  payload               The payload to embed into the donor TEE
  output                Where to write the crafted TEE (default: tz.img)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -d, --device DEVICE   Device to craft the image for (default: checkers)
  -p, --preloader PRELOADER
                        Preloader image spliced over the overwritten code
